        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Medical Plan coverage will continue to be made available to eligible employees and eligible dependents providing those benefits as were agreed upon during negotiations of this Agreement between the Union and the Employer. The Plan is subject to the terms, conditions and exclusions contained in the Plan Documents and is summarized in a Summary Plan Description which the Employer shall provide to eligible employees.",
